---
import Layout from '../layouts/Page.astro';
---
<Layout><main class="custom"><p class="eyebrow">CUSTOM / 03</p><h1>More than<br /><i>cars.</i></h1><p>Have another emblem, brand mark or personal symbol in mind? Tell us what you want to transform.</p><form><input placeholder="Name / Brand" /><input placeholder="Email" type="email" /><textarea placeholder="Tell us about the logo and what you imagine..."></textarea><button>SEND ENQUIRY ↗</button></form></main></Layout>
<style>:global(body){background:#f3f1eb;color:#151515;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif}.custom{padding:13vw 8vw;max-width:950px}.eyebrow{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.2em;opacity:.5}.custom h1{font-size:clamp(70px,11vw,155px);font-weight:400;line-height:.8;letter-spacing:-.06em;margin:80px 0 45px}.custom h1 i{font-family:Georgia,serif}.custom>p{font-size:20px;line-height:1.5;max-width:550px;opacity:.65}form{margin-top:80px;display:grid;gap:0}input,textarea{font:inherit;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid #999;background:transparent;padding:22px 0;font-size:17px}textarea{min-height:150px;resize:vertical}button{justify-self:start;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid #111;background:none;padding:20px 0;margin-top:30px;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.16em}</style>